OL,3,GNEWSAWheeled recycling bins for 63,000
OL,4,AYork homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of York homes could
OL,7,Fget a pair of wheeled bins for
OL,8,Frecycling collections instead of the
OL,9,F"three box" system most households
OL,10,Fcurrently use.
OL,12,FLeading members of Labour-run City of
OL,13,FYork Council are expected to approve
OL,14,Fthe switch when they meet next week.
OL,16,FA public consultation, which attracted
OL,17,Fin excess of 13,000 responses, found
OL,18,Fmore than 63% of responses said
OL,19,Fchanging to a wheeled bins would make
OL,20,Frecycling easier.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
