OL,3,GNEWSAWheeled recycling bins for 63,000
OL,4,AYork homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenny Kent, senior councillor
OL,7,Fresponsible for the environment, said:
OL,8,F"These proposals would give households
OL,9,Fmore capacity to recycle, help keep our
OL,10,Fstreets cleaner, improve safety for
OL,11,Fresidents and staff, and make sure York
OL,12,Fis ready for future recycling
OL,13,Frequirements."
